la Rosa</surname><given-names>FF</given-names></name><name><surname>Relimpio</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Purification and characterization of nitrate reductase from the halophile archaebacterium <italic>Haloferax mediterranei</italic></article-title><source>Z Naturforsch</source><year>1992</year><volume>47C</volume><fpage>670</fpage><lpage>676</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bickel-Sandk&#x000f6;tter</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ufer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Properties of a dissimilatory nitrate reductase from the halophilic archaeon <italic>Haloferax volcanii</italic></article-title><source>Z Naturforsch</source><year>1995</year><volume>50C</volume><fpage>365</fpage><lpage>372</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hochstein</surname><given-names>LI</given-names></name><name><surname>Lang</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Purification and properties of a dissimilatory nitrate reductase from <italic>Haloferax denitrificans</italic></article-title><source>Arch Biochem Biophys</source><year>1991</year><volume>288</volume><fpage>380</fpage><lpage>385</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1654831</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lled&#x000f3;</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Mart&#x000ed;nez-Espinosa</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Marhuenda-Egea</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonete</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Respiratory nitrate reductase from haloarchaeon <italic>Haloferax mediterranei</italic>: biochemic